{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0182D0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，说到Gálvez带来的那台卡带播放器……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"怎么了？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"那可不是什么东侧的仿制品。是货真价实的日本企业开发的原型机。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"真的！？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"对。上面刻着Sony的标志。型号叫WALKMAN。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":53,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"WALKMAN……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":13,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"它的理念很划时代：走路时也能享受音乐，把音乐从家里带出去。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"我也听过了。这么小的机器竟然有这种音质，而且还是立体声。可以肯定，它投入了相当高的技术。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":"AUX_CROSS_ROW_SPLIT_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"那盘磁带也是一样。高音域的延伸明显不同于现有卡带，设计也不错。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"这种还没上市的型号，Gálvez是怎么弄到手的？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":61,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"不知道。这也不像是古板的东侧会感兴趣的领域。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":"AUX_SOVIET_NARROWING_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"也是。不过这东西真不错。不挑地方，在哪都能听自己喜欢的音乐。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"真没想到会从你嘴里听到这种话。不过，我也赞同。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"我是现场录音派，本来觉得这种只能播放的便携机器简直无聊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"不过实际用过以后，我改观了。能把喜欢的音乐带出门……这也许会成为音乐的一场革命。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":"AUX_CROSS_ROW_SPLIT_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"嗯。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":"AUX_MEANING_DRIFT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"我也让Mother Base的工作人员进行分析和研究了。说不定以后还能做出改良型。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"}]}